{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2022-10-18 16:15:00', 'title': 'SWEP CONTINUES GLOBAL INVESTMENT PROGRAM WITH MANUFACTURING PLANT EXPANSIONS AND NEW R&D CENTER', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL. , OCT. 18, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SWEP, PART OF DOVER\xa0(NYSE: DOV)\xa0AND A WORLD-LEADING SUPPLIER OF BRAZED PLATE HEAT EXCHANGERS (BPHES), TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT IS EXPANDING ITS GLOBAL FOOTPRINT WITH MULTIPLE MANUFACTURING PLANT EXPANSIONS, A NEW R&D CENTER AND CORPORATE HEAD OFFICE.'}